### Test qcoder:latest response format for generate_tests tool
POST http://localhost:11434/api/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "qcoder:latest",
  "prompt": "Generate xunit tests for this C# code:\npublic class Calculator { public int Add(int a, int b) => a + b; }\nRespond ONLY with valid JSON: {\"files\": [{\"path\": \"CalculatorTests.cs\", \"content\": \"<test file content>\"}]}",
  "stream": false,
  "format": "json"
}
